cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, cite MorphoLab and separately cite the original dataset authors."
type: software
title: "MorphoLab: traceable wound-shape forecasting and research workbench"
authors:
  - name: "MorphoLab contributors"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-22
repository-code: "https://github.com/fzyz-whx/morpholab"
url: "https://github.com/fzyz-whx/morpholab"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A local research workbench for historical annotation-conditioned shape forecasting
  in in vivo Drosophila embryonic laser-wound microscopy. Includes audited data
  preparation, classical baselines, local NCA and ConvGRU models, held-out
  multiseed evaluation, negative ablations and persistent prediction jobs.
keywords:
  - neural cellular automata
  - morphodynamics
  - microscopy
  - reproducible research
